This crate bundles JavaScript sources (src/js/generated/*.js) that were
extracted, unmodified, from the build of the following projects. They are
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE):

* Playwright - https://github.com/microsoft/playwright
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

* Patchright - https://github.com/Kaliiiiiiiiii-Vinyzu/patchright
  (patchright-core, a patched build of playwright-core)
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation and the Patchright contributors.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The version of the package the scripts were extracted from is recorded in
src/js/generated/VERSION. Each file carries a header naming its origin.

The Rust code of this crate is an independent re-implementation of the
Playwright API; its behaviour, option names and error messages follow
Playwright's TypeScript sources (Apache License, Version 2.0).

oxidewright is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Microsoft or
the Playwright or Patchright projects. "Playwright" is a trademark of
Microsoft Corporation.

src/devices.json is Playwright's device descriptor list
(packages/isomorphic/deviceDescriptorsSource.json of Playwright 1.65.1),
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation, Apache License, Version 2.0.

src/js/page_binding_serializers.js is the `source()` function of
oldUtilityScriptSerializers.ts as built in patchright-core 1.64.3
(lib/coreBundle.js); src/binding.rs embeds `addPageBinding` and
`deliverBindingResult` of Patchright's server/pageBinding.ts.
